            "text": "<h3>5. In 40 days, look forward to your new shoes<\/h3><p><\/p><p>We'll measure the jeans, cut them, sew them, glue them. And voilà, the shoes are born! <\/p><p>We'll use patterns <strong>designed by physiotherapists<\/strong>, and our proven flexible sole. These shoes will take millions of steps with you.<\/p><p><\/p><p>Can't wait for your beloved jeans to get a second chance?<br\/>Send them to us today.<\/p><p><strong>Don't worry about payment now. <\/strong>We'll send you the payment information once the shoes are ready.<\/p>",
