    "accordion_k9TGhK": {
      "type": "accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "accor_item_e4PRt6": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Which jeans can you sew shoes from?",
            "content": "<p><strong>The sturdier the fabric, the better<\/strong>. Stretchy jeans unfortunately aren’t suitable for shoes – the shoe would deform and wouldn’t last. The jeans can happily be a little torn or worn.<\/p><p>Have you chosen lace-up <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.myshopify.com\/products\/damske-jaya-barefoot-vegan\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Women’s (late) autumn\/winter Jaya barefoot shoes in black\">Jaya<\/a> shoes, <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.myshopify.com\/products\/kozacky-barefoot-cerne\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Women’s black barefoot boots\">boots<\/a>, ankle boots <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.myshopify.com\/products\/damske-barefoot-trekking-bota-cerna\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Women’s black Sundara Ankle barefoot boots\">Sundara<\/a> or <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.myshopify.com\/products\/damske-barefoot-polokozacky-cerne\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Women’s black barefoot ankle boots\">ankle boots<\/a>? Please send us a large denim jacket or two pairs of jeans so we have enough material.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_4jADxR": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What shoes can you sew for me?",
            "content": "<p>Any of them you find in our <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/collections\/all\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Full Ahinsa shoes range\">range<\/a>. <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.myshopify.com\/products\/ahinsa-comfort-sandaly-cerne\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Women’s black sandals\">Sandals<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.myshopify.com\/products\/damske-vegan-barefoot-bindu-2-cerna\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Women’s black Bindu 2 Barefoot dress shoes\">dress shoes<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.myshopify.com\/products\/damske-vegan-barefoot-cerna-konopna-bindu\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Women’s black hemp Bindu 2 barefoot sneakers\">sneakers<\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.myshopify.com\/products\/ahinsa-bare-balerinka-cerna\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Ananda barefoot ballet flats for narrow feet\">ballet flats<\/a>,… <strong>It’s up to you.<\/strong> <\/p><p>Only for more complex models, such as <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.myshopify.com\/products\/kozacky-barefoot-cerne\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Women’s black barefoot boots\">boots<\/a> or <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.myshopify.com\/products\/damske-jaya-barefoot-vegan\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Women’s (late) autumn\/winter Jaya barefoot shoes in black\">ankle boots<\/a>, we need more material. <strong>Please send two pairs of jeans.<\/strong><\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_KfxmBG": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What happens if you can’t use my jeans?",
            "content": "<p><strong>We’ll let you know by email<\/strong> and agree the next steps. We’ll either return the jeans to you, or take care of ecological disposal. <\/p><p>But don’t be sad — we’ll gladly make you other shoes that nature is happy about. Take a look at our <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.myshopify.com\/pages\/recyklovana-edice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Recycled collection\">recycled Ahinsa In Love with Life collection<\/a>.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_VptqVn": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How much will I pay for the shoes?",
            "content": "<p>It depends on which model you choose. Denim shoes need more care in production, so they <strong>cost 20% more than our classic models<\/strong>. But with them, you know that no one else has a pair like yours.<\/p><p>For comparison, you can take a look at our other <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/collections\/panove\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">men's<\/span><\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/ahinsashoes.cz\/collections\/damy\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">women's<\/span><\/a> shoes.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_YfjV8y": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "When do I pay for the shoes?",
            "content": "<p>Once we make your shoes, we’ll send you payment details. Don’t worry about paying for now.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_xCnyrx": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Why does it take 40 days to make my shoes?",
            "content": "<p>Because we make them by hand. <strong>We measure, cut, glue and sew by hand.<\/strong> Quality takes time, and we give our shoes the care they deserve.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_pifBRM": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What warranty do you give on the shoes?",
            "content": "<p><strong>We stand behind all of our work for 2 years.<\/strong>If a shoe comes unglued, or anything goes wrong with the outsole or another part we made, we’ll take care of a repair or a replacement.<strong>We can’t, however, stand behind your denim<\/strong>, so the warranty doesn’t cover it.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_BG4Aac": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I don’t know how to choose my size. Can you help?",
            "content": "<p>Of course, we’d be glad to! <\/p><p>1.<strong> Trace an outline of both feet on a piece of paper.<\/strong> When tracing, keep the pencil upright and don’t draw under the foot.<\/p><p>2. Write the measurements onto the outline.<\/p><p>3. <strong>Send us the outline together with the jeans<\/strong>.<\/p><p>4. Attach a photo of your feet (you can send it to info@ahinsashoes.com).<\/p><p>We’ll get back to you and advise which size will fit.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "accor_item_xqURqR": {
          "type": "accor_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What if the shoes don’t fit. Can I return them?",
            "content": "<p>We sewed the denim shoes especially for you, so unfortunately you <strong>cannot return them<\/strong>. <\/p><p>We recommend paying close attention to the right size when you choose. If you’re unsure, we’re happy to help — write to us at <a href=\"mailto:info@ahinsashoes.com\" title=\"mailto:info@ahinsashoes.com\">info@ahinsashoes.com<\/a>.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
